note Run from the top of every frame like poll_disk: when the rebuild thread has an index, this is the frame that swaps it in. The whole cost of a re-index lands here - the carry-over, the re-resolve and the re-render - and it is one frame, not the whole rebuild. Search results are dropped because their file and line indices no longer mean anything, the watcher gets the new modification times so it starts looking again, and whatever changed is sent to the servers.

